reference/

# The master build instruction is a private working document.
QUITTANCE_BUILD_INSTRUCTION.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. Nothing below this line may ever reach a commit.
#
# `.keys/` holds funded devnet keypairs in plaintext, which is how the Solana
# CLI stores them. They are devnet-only and hold no real value, but they are
# still signing keys and they stay out of history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*-keypair.json
keys/
.keys/
**/.keys/
id.json
payer.json
adversary.json

